        "subject": "LU-19682 tests: skip sanity-lnet/256 with old servers",
        "message": "LU-19682 tests: skip sanity-lnet/256 with old servers\n\nsanity-lnet/256 verifies that a router does not drop messages that\nare past their deadline. That behavior was added by LU-17854, but\nthe routers in an interop run are the servers, so with b2_15 servers\nthe router still drops the delayed GET messages and the pings fail\nwith EIO. Skip the test when the servers predate the fix.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet serverversion=2.15\nFixes: 182b0101d3 (\"LU-17854 lnet: Router should not drop msg past deadline\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ic61b360e3e9df3087a0145d51fcda80cddf36daa\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
